said, "but .plan files and the system message board are seen by
everyone, we should keep them fairly clean" 

In the second incident, same week, I fingered another student and saw
another limerick of a similar nature. I approached this student and
said something like "That's a pretty explicit .plan file you have
there." The student turned BEET red and said "you SAW that? I just put
that there for my friend." "Anyone can see your .plan file, I said,
including your professor." 
